The most recent version of the Mercedes-Benz CLS 300dh is the CLS 300d Mild Hybrid (MHEV) from the C257 generation (2018-2023 facelift). The 'h' in 300dh refers to the mild-hybrid system integrated into the 300d model. Therefore, the specifications and ratings are the same as the CLS 300d.

